[36m(TaskRunner pid=439121)[0m ### Step 3: Solve system of equations
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439121)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439121)[0m From Equation 1:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439121)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439121)[0m $$
