[36m(TaskRunner pid=439121)[0m Convert 1.6 to a fraction: $ 1.6 = \frac{8}{5} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439121)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439121)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439121)[0m \frac{18}{s(s + 2)} = \frac{8}{5}
